    "answer": {
      "points": [
        "Nuisance requests totaled 7,170, the most common type, representing 25.8% of the 27,817 total requests received in 2025.",
        "Ask 3-1-1 requests totaled 3,321, the second most common type, representing 11.9% of all requests.",
        "The next most common types were Inquiries (1,229, 4.4%), Parking On Front Lawn (1,038, 3.7%), and Traffic Issues for Montgomery Police Dept (681, 2.4%).",
        "All 311 request types listed in the data are from the City of Montgomery's 311 service request system; retrieval date was 2026-10-25.",
        "The data covers 9 months of 2025 (January through September); October through December records are not included in the source dataset."
      ],
      "caveats": [
        "The dataset covers 9 months of 2025 (Jan–Sep); October–December records are not included, so totals are not a complete annual count.",
        "Counts are raw request numbers; no population or exposure rates are provided.",
        "The source publication date for the 2025 data is listed as 2025-08-05, but the retrieval occurred in 2026; exact publication timing is uncertain."
      ],
      "headline": "Nuisance and Ask 3-1-1 were the top two Montgomery 311 request types in 2025, together making up 37.7% of all requests.",
      "how_sure": "The ranking is based on raw request counts from the City of Montgomery's 311 system; 27,817 records were retrieved with event dates from 2025-01-01 to 2025-09-30. Only 9 of 12 months are covered, so the figures represent partial-year activity and are not a full annual total."
    },
